<title>MALAYSIA: Jutajaya gets SC nod for Kemayan unit buy.</title>
<headline>Jutajaya gets SC nod for Kemayan unit buy.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial net maker Jutajaya Bhd said it has received approval from the Securities Commission to buy Kemayan Construction Sdn Bhd for 120 million ringgit.</p>
<p>Kemayan Construction is a subsidiary of Kemayan Corporation Bhd.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be satisfied by the issuance of 11.43 million shares of Jutajaya at 10.50 ringgit per share.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
